OL,3,GNEWSAResidents baffled as Olympic gold
OL,4,Apostbox blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new Royal Mail parcel box has been
OL,7,Fplaced in front of a celebratory
OL,8,FOlympics gold postbox, leaving
OL,9,Fresidents frustrated with where it has
OL,10,Fbeen put.
OL,12,FThe postbox in Alcester, Warwickshire,
OL,13,Fwas painted to mark Nick Skelton's gold
OL,14,Fmedal at the 2012 London Olympics, and
OL,15,Fresidents told the BBC they want it
OL,16,Frestored to prominence urgently.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35402
SC,0002
