OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F354A1793206567
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAResidents baffled as Olympic gold
OL,4,Apostbox blocked
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail said the new box would
OL,7,Fincrease choice for customers, but
OL,8,Fcouncillor Tom Ballinger called for it
OL,9,Fto move to a "more suitable" location,
OL,10,Fhighlighting the postbox's significance
OL,11,Fto the area.
OL,13,F"It symbolises something very special
OL,14,Ffor the town: that we have someone who
OL,15,Flives in the area that was part of
OL,16,Fthose games," he said.
